Just a bunch of small fixes.

1) Fixed an error which caused the game to infinitely save on the host side;
2) Fixed a bug which caused player's character to randomly get stuck after resurrection;
3) Fixed a bug with missing colliders at the hospital;
4) Fixed a bug which made players who construct a workbench within buildings to stay inside;
5) Fixed errors in English and German localization regarding in-game tips and tutorials.

Hey survivors!
Just a bunch of small but important fixes and updates. 

Fixes:

— Fixed a bug which caused save files to disappear from loading menu;
— FIxed a bug which caused cursor to stay inside an initial window borders when going full-screen;
— FIxed a bug which caused weapons to randomly inflict damage upon touching objects;
— Fixed a bug which stopped character from restoring heat after reaching HUB station;
— Fixed a bug which caused vegetable growind animation to halt after loading the game;
— Fixed a bug which caused disappearance of ammo upon dragging it out of equipment screen.

Changes:

— Changed the hunger growth rate, depending on the amount of heat: the less heat, the faster the hunger is growing.

